"body": "We have released fix version 2.31.1, which rolls back Npcap to version 1.85. The Npcap team has confirmed that version 1.85 does not contain the regression responsible for the recent issue.\n\nThis issue impacted Windows Endpoint Agents only.\n\nAll affected devices will automatically update to version 2.31.1 as soon as possible. No customer action is required.",
